{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"Once they are both in front of Copper, he smiles to each of them. He takes a breath, then begins:","created_at":"2020-08-02T00:16:46.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739275468070715403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"||”Shhh! I love you too.”||","created_at":"2020-08-02T00:17:01.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739275531861885018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"“Ladies and Gentlemen, today I am honored to be in the presence of those who have overcome many challenges to stand before you today. They stand before us, wishing for us to share in there happiest moment of there lives. We have come here, to celebrate and support the choice of Sir Cato and Knight Arctura to join in marriage.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T00:17:09.101000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739275562186702888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"“Love is a miraculous gift, and a wedding is a celebration of that magic, and that’s why we are here today—to share in that magic.\nMarriage is also a place of freedom. Freedom to fully express who you are, knowing that you have someone there to catch you when you fall, encourage you when you are discouraged, and applaud your successes.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T00:17:27.623000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739275639873470466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"“May the life you choose to share, lavishly fulfill each of you, inspiring you to give abundantly to the rest of the world. May the promises you make here today, reflect the love and sincerity of your truest intention for this union. When life is peaceful and when it is painful, may you continuously be reminded of the beauty and deepest intention of the vows you make here.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T00:17:34.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739275668646527027","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"He looks back to Cato and Arctura, “now, I understand each of you have decided to write your one vows. Please, speak them, for all to hear and bare witness.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T00:18:26.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739275888830709830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
